{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1258.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"2463a2129c7cda40cd29d9f1361feef9e262579712c66b5c397d533c584c3a53","ja":"その次の日……","zh":"到了第二天……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1258.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"799fe0605b676e11c84b67ad9717b70b91a2d34123e867d1333e86bc65eaf8c5","ja":"高坂さん、昨日からなんだかソワソワしていますが\n何かあったのでしょうか？　……気になるぞ。","zh":"高坂同学从昨天起就总有些心神不定的，\n是发生了什么事吗？……真让人在意啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1258.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"1e8b232772cdf80a9c949ae3c5654b5c2dadc9a59d00f49ce40cd5e3265a5325","ja":"それは……私、昨日聞いちゃったんだ。\n……美也が電話で婚約の話をしているの。","zh":"那是……我昨天不小心听到了。\n……美也在电话里聊订婚的事。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1258.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"243dfb3a2015a1f30fde92eb98829e96ff35afd1e0b17609ef30e6142ce15316","ja":"えっ、婚約……ですか！？","zh":"诶，订婚……吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1258.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"c74aa3c59dae622ac1068fb8f9cacc1a59cddacc723b56d4210c4e1b3cb4e391","ja":"「婚約は予定通りに」、とかなんとかって……。\nでもさ、さすがに美也がってことじゃないよね！？","zh":"“婚约按原计划进行”，好像是这么说的……\n不过，再怎么说也不可能是美也吧！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1258.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1efbfb99781547743919e7958b0c5ec3bb68f08aafc2983927709f13b19e6481","ja":"だって私たち、まだ結婚できない年齢だし！","zh":"毕竟我们还没到能结婚的年龄呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1258.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"2417053474e0ef4e57535c09977b87c7218517c4b1e57a58836e4ede16f8de5b","ja":"確かにそうですが、\n婚約自体に年齢制限はなかったような……。","zh":"确实是这样没错，\n但订婚本身好像是没有年龄限制的……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1258.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"9a1ef867d16260ba71a5876492e50f5363f1cd8c9fae61528348842a38928dc1","ja":"ええっ！？\nじゃあ、ありえない話じゃないってこと！？","zh":"咦！？\n也就是说，不是没可能咯！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1258.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"6a8e1821c466d4e69cd6740fed087caf4be3e962bed63abb6343bb3ac466ebdd","ja":"はい、ですがもしそれが本当なら……\nとても衝撃的だぞ。","zh":"是的，但如果那是真的……\n可就太让人震惊了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1258.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"033619b5c49c2dba810034b3938b2f3db77ade84670f3cf07f68fc2a428d8b71","ja":"だ、だよねっ！？\n高校生で婚約って、どーなるんだろー……。","zh":"就、就是说啊！？\n高中生就订婚的话，到底会变成怎样啊……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1258.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"dc3765023c7481a633b163b58aafdf45c4168418811d8bbebec5629fd76b6b81","ja":"お疲れ様です～。昨日ぶりですね～。\nなんのお話をしていたんですか～？","zh":"辛苦了～。昨天才见过呢～。\n你们在聊什么呢～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1258.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"b9ff650995a15744b371d97755e66c895ae958299b526f4c3fd565b579b52b20","ja":"わあっ、美也！？　ええと、ええと……\nこ、今度の日曜日に何しようかな～……とか！？","zh":"哇啊，美也！？那个，那个……\n在、在想这个周日要做什么好呢～……之类的！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1258.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"b5d97059b3136e058cf71fa1c978dfe9ff6f6abe43952e02339fa427eb8b4ce7","ja":"そうでしたか～。今度の日曜日……\nむふふ、私はとっても大事な用があるんですよ～。","zh":"原来是这样啊～。这个星期天……\n嘿嘿，我可是有非常重要的事要办哦～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1258.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"ba798bd3d6b95965cb84cf2997e4b468cb74b6d917c0085063faeb9de45567e1","ja":"大事な用……それって、もしかして……。","zh":"重要的事情……难道说，那是……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
